      '- `js/autopilot.js` (arrival distances), `js/game-core.js` `startGame`, `js/game-intro.js` `setupNormalGameContent` / `startNormalGameplay` (the seam), `js/outer-systems.js`, `js/proc-galaxies.js` (scale reference), `js/camera-system.js`.',
