      '',
      '## What to do',
      '1. **Measure the ORIGINAL experience first**, on ORIGINAL, over a 150 s demo and a staged flight toward the nearest belt: for each asteroid kind, how many are within 2,000 / 8,000 / 30,000 of the player over time; how many are on screen at 3 px or more; how often the player passes within 1,000 of a rock; how many rocks get shot, hit and destroyed. That table is the target.',
