      'Switch: `asteroids` (`original` is the default and should now mean "as present as in ORIGINAL, scaled for this world").',
      '',
      '## Verify',
      'The measurement table for ORIGINAL, hybrid before, hybrid after. One contact sheet: a belt from far, from mid range and from inside it, ORIGINAL beside yours. A frame of the view from the Sol start with rocks identifiable in it. A staged shot of a rock being destroyed. keep-check; a 3 x 180 s demo soak (`scripts/demo-soak.mjs`) with no collision deaths — more rocks must not kill the demo pilot. Name the constants Ben can tune (counts, sizes, distances).',
      '',
